Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果又有什么事情发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something broke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说都会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.64,0:00:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对事情的看法不再一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't see things the same way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看待事物的角度也不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our roles in this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法再相信你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得好像这句话就是万灵药一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like it's some sort of cure-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像这样就能改变事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it can change the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}That everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,之所以会如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That have ever gone wrong between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has been because we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.33,0:00:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,十三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.61,0:00:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,十一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,十\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,七\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六 - 不能那么小口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Six - No chipmunking allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 四三二 - 咽下去 不然你就失去资格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Four, three, two - Swallow!Or you're disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们分出胜负了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we got a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他作弊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:01:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个瘦猴 滚开 我可是赢得正大光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, back off, Skeletor.I won fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.21,0:01:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得真像这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell you did, Jabba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你把一个热狗塞进裤子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you slip a hotdog in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 我不想这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to break it to you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我裤子里的可不是热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not hot dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚睡觉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go to bed last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh…no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在放Rudy\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, "Rudy" was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,放不可原谅的时候 我已经睡不着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unforgiven", and then I was too jacked to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 还是起来做研究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, research.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron 该隐之印 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Metatron, Mark of Cain and.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的蟋蟀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过找到了个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did find a case, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.68,0:03:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是场离奇的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a strange death in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在明尼苏达 斯蒂尔沃特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stillwater Minnesota.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名参赛选手在吃热狗比赛之后死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A competitive eater died after a hot dog eating contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.58,0:03:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 因为热狗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?Death by tube steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可能是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.41,0:03:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在自己车里遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got attack in his car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的体重从三百磅缩减到了九十磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shrunk from three hundred pounds to ninety pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫的巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是因为强力泻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a heavy-duty laxative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.13,0:03:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.16,0:03:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去冲个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's a whore's bath for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be ready in five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你没事吗 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you're okay, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为我那天说的话 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about what I said the other day, is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我们不应该再做兄弟的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}About we are not suppose to be brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.12,0:03:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别自作多情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't break that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 因为我只是说了实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, cause I was just being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我听得清清楚楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah.I got that loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.73,0:04:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你们的耐心等等 探员们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for your paitients, agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coroner的报告终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coroner's report finally came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者在死亡之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Wayne McNut really weight three hundred pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的重达三百磅吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just moments before the time of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确的说是三百十六磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred sixteen to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,官方的死亡原因是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the official cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,心搏停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cardiac arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也只在你我之间说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But between you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还只是个猜测\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害者有大量器官遭到损坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vic suffered massive organ damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 Jenny\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,脾破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruptured spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝脏穿孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pierced liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,肺部被拍碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collapsed lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.59,0:04:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像所有东西从他身体里被吸出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like everthing just sucked right out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像他被吸尘器给吸干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like he'd been hoovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须诚实的说 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta be honest, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们简直惊呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事情不会发生在斯蒂尔沃特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This type of thing just doesn't happened in Stillwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他平时有仇人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Wayne have any enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.93,0:04:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是不大友好的竞争对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like an unfriendly rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫瘦子Jim Morgan的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy named "Slim Jim" Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,像Wayne一样 他因为参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Wayne, he was pretty well-known.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胃王比赛而出名\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the competitive eating circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里那算是件大事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a big thing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,市民把这些比赛看得很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks take it real seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,会花上几个月去训练 吃些乱七八糟的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Train for months, eat all sorts of wackadoo stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如烤豆 鸡翅 黄油\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like, bake beans, buff wings, butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 有时候还是油炸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sometimes deep fried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是今年\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne赢得了黄油超级碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne won the Butter Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡翅比赛 还有吃鲜虾大赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Wing Ding and Shrimptasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywoo, point being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne McNut是整个地区唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne McNut was the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦子Jim打败不了的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slim Jim couldn't beat in the whole region.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他就是嫌疑犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is he the suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去调查过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We checked him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Wince死亡的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Slim Jim was in the Hot Doggery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Slim Jim正在热狗大赛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time of Wayne's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.03,0:05:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有15个目击证人可以证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got fifteen witnesses to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我准备比赛前 我都会吃生菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I gear up a competition, I eat lettuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:05:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能锻炼我的肠胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It strenches the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有理由远离沙拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a reason to stay away from salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你了解Wayne McNut多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How well did you know Wayne McNut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道他是个卑鄙的作弊者\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I have to know is he is a weasel and a cheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想这么说 不过这就是因果报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to say it, but karma's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mala的幸运符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mala's good-luck charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么Mala是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mala is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子很迷信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your lady superstitious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她是Romanichal\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she is Romanichal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Romanichal\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romanichal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gypsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这样称呼她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't call her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说这很掉价\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says it's reductive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我觉得这是种赞美\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think it's a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说电视节目上的吉普赛人很多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Gypsies are all the range on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 我的盛大吉普赛婚礼 吉普赛姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My big fat Gypsy wedding, Gypsy sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上卡戴珊的时尚脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping up with Kardashians.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意我用一下你的卫生间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I use your bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是用楼上后面那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But use the one up the stairs at the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子在主卫里面洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mala's taking a shower in ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的以一个热狗之差输掉了比赛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really lose the "Wiener Winner" by one dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:06:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说到哪了 六英尺长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are we talking?Six inches?Foot-long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员先生 我现在难道是嫌疑人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent, am I a suspect here or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们手里有搜查证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause…unless you got a warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.86,0:07:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以了吗 - 没问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready to go? - Yea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morgan先生 我们感谢您的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Morgan, we thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.81,0:07:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想起什么其他情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you remember anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where we're staying locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有了Wayne McNut的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got what appear to be Wayne McNut's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一袋子诡异的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a bag full of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在Romanichal文化里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the Romanichal culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个袋子被称作浦西巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pouch is called Putsi Bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用来下诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's used for hexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以Mala在丈夫的比赛上下了诅咒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?Mala's putting hexes on hubby's competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.86,0:08:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对付的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what do we got ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦针什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A "thinner" sitch here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦子Jim可能都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slim Jim might not even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.68,0:08:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们拿了我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you have something of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了Wayne么可能 我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill Wayne?I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我们一直在偷情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, okay, we are having an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想失礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 你怎么会喜欢他那种类型\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…how is it Wayne McNut is your type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你结婚的那个男人如此瘦弱年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're married to a man who is barely a buck, wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 有时候赠与的感觉很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say, sometimes it's nice to feel a little give.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢我明白啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像加一点调料\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little cushion for the.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你爱他 为什么你还要诅咒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you love Wayne, why did you put a curse on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.45,0:09:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,浦西巫术袋也可以用来保佑别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putsi Bags are also used for blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.45,0:09:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted Wayne to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来计划是拿到财产就赶紧离婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan was, take the prize money, get the quickie divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在奥兰多结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then tie the knot in Orlando.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne以前叫我茉莉公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne used to call me princess Jasmine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然又胖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gained weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:10:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.89,0:11:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,重称一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人之前多重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what the vic weighed beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,165磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}165.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是 180磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, 180.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,众所周知 所有女人都在体重和年龄上撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known fact.All women lie about their weight and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我怎么记得你跟那个女服务生说你29岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you told that waitress the other day you were 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要什么吗 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need anything else?Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hanscum警长什么时候来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, is sheriff Hanscum around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这周她去休假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, she's out for the rest of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是会挑时候啊是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a time to take a vacation right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have two victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来毫无关联的受害人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With seemingly nothing in common except.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对甜食的极度热爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The love for eclairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 胎记吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that, a birthmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么体重减轻了是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the weight had to come off somehow, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是个吸痕呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's a suction mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suction mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,换生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, changeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们不对孩子下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah but changelings don't take over kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个受害者都没有孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of the vics had any.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没不知道Wayne McNut有没有吸痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if Wayne McNut had a suction mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:12:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们疏忽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless we missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.85,0:13:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个去停尸房看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of us should hit the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个留在这儿跟工作人员聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other should stat here and question the staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.34,0:13:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.69,0:13:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和女的相处得奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are weird around girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.97,0:13:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean, weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尴尬的那种奇怪 Sam那种奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awkward-weird.Sam-weired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.22,0:13:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉兄弟 我说实话而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry man.I'm just being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚是你值班关闭体育馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you were scheduled to close the gym last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但我并没关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I didn't exactly lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carol还在健身而我马上有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol was still working out and I had a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想因此而耽误了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't want to shortchange her you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为了自己的婚礼不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean the poor girls had been working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要减肥成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lose weight for her wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.75,0:13:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把钥匙交给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slipped her the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.34,0:13:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她走时锁门就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I told her to lock up on her way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在停尸房有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got anything at the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wayne虽然已经瘦得不成人形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.So Wayne was banged pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是还能看出在他脖子后面 发际线以下的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on the back of his neck just below his hairline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个吸吮痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suction mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,和Carol的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identical to Carol's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.37,0:14:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说他们都被标记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay so they both have marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是在罗兹体育馆工作的那个性感教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the hot trainer at Rollz.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很瘦而且她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was skinny and alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚减下很多重量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just recently lost a ton of weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一问那个印是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I asked about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就尴尬起来 不说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She clammed up, got all embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我查了一下 最后发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I did some checking and it turns out that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子她上个月去这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took a couple me days last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息了几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And went here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大峡谷健身中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canyon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:14:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你照镜子时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得镜子里同样在注视你的胖子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recognize the fat person staring back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否试过所有的减肥食谱和瘦身锻炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you tried every fat diet every fitness trend out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.13,0:15:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但效果却差强人意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it turned out nothing seemed to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大峡谷健身中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here at Canyon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.66,0:15:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保证不用手术即可减肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We guarantee weight loss with no surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,无须采用极端食谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No extreme diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,无须采用高强度训练法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no intensive workout regimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期保证有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guaranteed results in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以达到减肥目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can reach your weight loss goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就达到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在犹豫什么 拿起你手中的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only if you reach for the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大峡谷健身中心预定位置吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And call Canyon Valley.Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方离这多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far away is that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这儿不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看了网上的广告片很受触动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were really really moved by the online testimonials.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常给力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah it was some powerful stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个都是专业的健身教练吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you boys are both certified personal trainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.79,0:15:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们是私人健身教练兄弟组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Personal training brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.73,0:15:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像Hans和Franz 只不过不是德国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kinda like Hans and Franz but less German.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的专长是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're certified in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人出汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making people sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,叱咤风云雷厉风行 这是我们的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Kicking ass and taking names.It's how we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单解释一下 我哥的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}To clarify.What my brother is trying to say is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都热爱健身和帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both have a passion for fitness and helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是 其实我们就是因此相遇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us too.In fact, that's how we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Maritza在秘鲁的第一个客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was Maritza's first client back in Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我在留学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on a student visa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想家 压力大 企图以吃解闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homesick, stressed, eating my troubles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他胖得像房子一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh he was a size of a casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时差点儿就得了心脏病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was one empanada away from a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.17,0:16:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是后来 我碰上了这位神赐般的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then this gorgeous godsend made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.04,0:16:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是才有了今天这个壮实健康的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lean, mean, fighting machine I am today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我扯远了 好消息是我们招人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I digressed.The good news is we are hiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad news is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一个健身教练的空位\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one training position available.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,去别的部门工作怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about working in another department.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,短裤不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,发网不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice hairnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.55,0:17:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么让我来当食堂阿姨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Why do I get to be the lunch lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从什么时候起挨着吃的还抱怨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do you ever complain about being around food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才不是吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is not food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, new guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和教练搭讪了 快回来干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit flirting with the trainer and keep scoopin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的瑜伽班还有五分钟就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My, uh, Ashtanga yoga class starts in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么学会瑜伽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell do you know anything about yoga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟瑜伽老师约过会的可不止你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one who’s ever dated someone bendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你这儿有燕麦粥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you have any oatmeal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们有豆腐做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No but we have something that's tofu over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是煎饼 也是豆腐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pancake, it's tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道听起来很胆小 但是我想问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fell like a baby asking this but.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种疗法疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the treatment hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:17:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔罐的唯一缺点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only drawback of cupping is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:18:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是会留下一个吸痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It leaves a suction mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有点淤青\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can bruise a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cupping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 古代中国秘籍 明星都做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ancient Chinese secret.All the celebrities do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以排毒 促进新陈代谢 感觉很舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}It draws out toxin, boosts metabolism.You will feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.81,0:18:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里太舒适了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just so relaxing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是香料疗法 薰衣草效果很强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the aromatherapy, the lavender really packs a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊真暖和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh geez that's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒惰鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你那点儿休息的功夫 你早把卫生做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got time to lean, you got time to clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.43,0:19:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we get to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和顾客们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same with the clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想让我们吃兔粮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they expect us to eat this rabbit food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是兔粮是营养餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not rabbit food it's superfood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.51,0:19:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不吃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not eating that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.72,0:20:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大峡谷健身中心 员工首先要以身作则\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Canyon Valley, we lead by examples.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是咱们要以身做的则吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is leading-by example.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.75,0:20:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是给我们的 蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for us stupido.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.77,0:20:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给客人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被允许把布丁加到减肥理疗日的食谱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're allowed to put pudding on their a spa day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是最后的狂欢一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a, last hurrah for the real work starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.30,0:20:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frank 我们需要买进更多的笋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Frank, we need to order more asparagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.32,0:20:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想得到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天也是我的减肥理疗日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my spa day too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.11,0:20:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的各位 慢慢提高 就像是倒趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, good job guys, go to, uh, downward dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持这个姿势五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前才30秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 30秒 我就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right, thirty seconds, that's what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我下来检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们的姿势正不正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure everybody's form is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.50,0:21:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你们跟上了课程进度 然后你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you keep your cores tight and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.49,0:21:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得很好 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的腰挺直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just straight your back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.03,0:21:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天很不错 做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done today, good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 各位 做得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, guys, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namaste, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work, see you all soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.98,0:22:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,课上的怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was class.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.20,0:22:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…uh great, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.27,0:22:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freli探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Freli.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.98,0:22:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freli探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Freli.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 她现在精神状态不大好可能认错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, she must be pretty out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.47,0:22:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个电话必须接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 祝你有美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.76,0:22:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,地瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.39,0:23:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.11,0:23:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.81,0:23:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.01,0:23:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.44,0:23:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被下药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.05,0:23:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,下药 你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drugged, what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.01,0:23:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是给客人准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was supposed to be for the clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.47,0:23:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我无法抗拒它的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,咸味焦糖布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salted caramel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 兄弟 全世界最好的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, man, best of both the worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,又甜又咸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salty and sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:24:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你在这儿待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我和你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先吧 我等下会去找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, man, I'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,布丁是你做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, did you make the pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.92,0:24:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.47,0:24:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你喜不喜欢咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you like or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面加了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.37,0:24:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 Jack Lalanne\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Jack Lalanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.33,0:24:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有淡奶油 脱脂奶 海盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's low cal, non fat milk, sea salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不是材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.44,0:24:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是其他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The something extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.05,0:24:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点儿 伙计 保健品好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill, man, supplements, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.50,0:24:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么保健品\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of supplements.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.84,0:24:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.30,0:24:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,促进新陈代谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To boost metalbolism.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.65,0:24:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,经由Larry和Maritza推荐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Per Larry and Maritza.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.87,0:24:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这些保健品的关系 是催眠药\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not supplyments, the roofies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.69,0:24:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是催眠药\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, how do you know the roofies' like.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.78,0:24:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.49,0:24:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会想要醒来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I wanna end up in the.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.10,0:25:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现自己在酒店浴缸里 发现肾被割掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hotel bath tub with my kidney carved out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.28,0:25:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在车臣之类的鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Chechnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.87,0:25:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上瑜伽课有没有发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything out in the yoga.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.83,0:25:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 掠夺者的身体烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, invasion of the body snatchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.54,0:25:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,课上的每个人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single person in the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.17,0:25:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有着诡异的吮吸痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has one of those freaky ass suction marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.83,0:25:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.05,0:25:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意要放你们鸽子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I didn't mean to bail on you, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.39,0:25:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我等了六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I've been waiting for six months to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.73,0:25:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,才进来大峡谷健身中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get into the Canyon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell you, it's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.89,0:25:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经减了十磅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already lost ten pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.42,0:25:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天之内吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In, in one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.30,0:25:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.22,0:25:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 你看起来状态很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, cause you look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你就没有好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But aren't you at least a bit curious that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.88,0:25:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一天怎么能减下来这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dropped ten a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.41,0:25:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们实话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well to tell you the truth, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.58,0:25:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a flying fudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.67,0:25:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫Doug去年离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband Doug left me last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.26,0:25:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢曲奇奶昔胜过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved cookie dough milkshake more than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.20,0:25:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 Doug是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Doug's a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:25:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该得到更好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.41,0:26:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那段是我的黑暗时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a dark time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.19,0:26:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说吃掉你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever said you eat your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.07,0:26:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是 我把痛苦一饮而尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me, I guzzled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.28,0:26:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.93,0:26:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我只想再次变美罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just wanted to feel pretty again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.14,0:26:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而大峡谷健身中心帮我完成了心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Canyon Valley did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.83,0:26:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only question is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.54,0:26:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在做卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜到这一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sort of get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.69,0:26:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们觉得这里和\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think there's a connection between.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.11,0:26:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,市里的谋杀有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canyon Valley and murders in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.79,0:26:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.60,0:26:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,吮吸痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suction marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.40,0:26:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说的是这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.96,0:26:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那是怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where's that come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My spa treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:26:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cupping.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.02,0:26:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拔罐 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cupping - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.73,0:27:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为会很痛 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I thought it was gonna hurt.But honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡一觉就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A snoozed through the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.47,0:27:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我醒来时整整瘦了一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I woke up, I was down two dress sizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.80,0:27:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔罐前你有吃布丁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the cupping, did you eat any pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.46,0:27:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 把碗舔了个干干净净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darn tootin.Lick the bowl clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.41,0:27:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得是谁进行那次治疗的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember who did this treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you betcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evelyn你看起来好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn, you're looking great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.82,0:27:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再减十磅 你就完成任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ten more pounds, til your goal weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.48,0:27:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意我占用我妻子一点时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I borrow my wife for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.78,0:27:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来真不错 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的那两个不是私人健身教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new guys aren't personal trainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.89,0:27:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一些调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did more digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.80,0:27:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他们的车里发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this in their glove compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're Feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.73,0:27:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟糕 他们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse, they're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么猎人会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hunters' here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.52,0:27:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是因为这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe because of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.85,0:27:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是不是认为 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you think - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.25,0:27:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.38,0:27:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我会处理的 你只要尽量销毁证据就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, I'll take care of it, just get rid of the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.52,0:28:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不是健康主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm no health nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.58,0:28:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.59,0:28:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is just wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.31,0:28:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.58,0:29:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ihis isn't what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.61,0:29:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.49,0:29:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, what are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.88,0:29:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是吸脂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a pishtaco.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.74,0:29:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鱼肉卷饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fish taco.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.56,0:29:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸脂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pishtaco.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.34,0:29:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是秘鲁吸脂怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means Peruvian fat sucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.92,0:29:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们跟吸血鬼差不多是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, you're like the vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.16,0:29:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过在饮食上更偏好脂肪\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a sweet tooth for cellulite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.32,0:29:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.61,0:29:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是寄生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just parasites.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.68,0:29:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会伤害人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I would never hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.72,0:29:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么Larry和我开了这家大峡谷健身中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is why Larry and I started Canyon Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.92,0:29:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮人们减肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help people lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.73,0:29:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也能够获取食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I could feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.85,0:29:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是双赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a win win.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.87,0:29:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是没错 但是你把两个人活活吸光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, except for the two you dysoned to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.83,0:29:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That isn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.15,0:29:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.30,0:29:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alonso\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alonso.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.91,0:29:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,餐厅里的那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dude in cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.13,0:29:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你欲望很强烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.83,0:30:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不像你妹妹那样强大有自制力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike your sister, you are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.71,0:30:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 Larry\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you, too, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.56,0:30:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样对她\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.87,0:30:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.11,0:30:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.99,0:30:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.86,0:30:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有猎人找上门来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now there're hunters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.46,0:30:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是你们的错 你个白鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault, blanco.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.58,0:30:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你们俩不让我随意进食\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you didn't starve me maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.77,0:30:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你这个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.40,0:30:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个机构花费了我和你妹妹几年的心血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister and I spent years building this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.42,0:30:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna let you gluttony destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.52,0:30:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got other things coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.53,0:30:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你滚 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you out, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.74,0:30:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开Maritza的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving Maritza.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.52,0:30:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么跟你说吧 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I got news for you pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.24,0:30:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不希望你留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't want you here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.97,0:30:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你自己走人 要么我亲自帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either you leave, or I'll make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.56,0:31:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把Alonso从秘鲁带到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought Alonso here from Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了向他展示一个更好的生存方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}To show him a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.79,0:31:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个更能被世人接受的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}A more civilized way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.70,0:31:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们不再是怪物的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}One where we weren't monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和人类和平相处的秘诀是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The secret to co-existing with humans was just.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.97,0:31:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,进食适量让我们得以生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating enough to getby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.96,0:31:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.86,0:31:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alonso并不喜欢这种方式 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alonso wasn't a big fan of portion control, was he.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.31,0:31:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.59,0:31:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在进行常规治疗的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the routine treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.20,0:31:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他差点儿杀死了一个客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He almost killed a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.82,0:31:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他吸食的脂肪太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sucked out too much fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就把他安排在了厨房后勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I demoted him to kitchen duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.92,0:32:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免与人类直接接触 吃罐装脂肪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No human contact, just fat from the jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.62,0:32:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越是约束着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more I deprived him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.37,0:32:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就越饥饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hungrier he got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.96,0:32:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有三个人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now three people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.32,0:32:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.07,0:32:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在Alonso在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Alonso right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The-the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.86,0:32:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大部分时间都待在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where he spends most of his time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.47,0:32:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.23,0:32:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她想明白到底是站在哪一边的之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, until we have to figure out which side she's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.23,0:32:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不能给她松绑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's staying put.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.13,0:32:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是站在你们这一边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.60,0:32:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然如此 怎么才能杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then how do we kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.67,0:33:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.45,0:34:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,私人领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.91,0:35:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一点机会都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and stupido have no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.98,0:35:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,脂肪能让我们变得更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fat makes us stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.24,0:35:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妹妹可没说这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister didn't mentioned that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.09,0:35:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出卖了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she ratted you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.24,0:35:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.71,0:35:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜在你杀了她丈夫之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess after you killed her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.71,0:35:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她终于忍受不了你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too monstrous even for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.60,0:36:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 非常感谢你们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for everything, we'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.96,0:37:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.91,0:37:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么跟警察解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you tell the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.96,0:37:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个逍遥法外的疯子杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psycho killer on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.29,0:37:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们 通常都很吃这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}They, uh, usually buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.06,0:37:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一天里失去了所有的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my whole family today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.84,0:37:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.53,0:37:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能跟你谈个事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I steal you a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.86,0:37:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这里都搞定了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this place clears out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们就准备让她们全家团圆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us make her a family affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.56,0:37:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能杀了Maritza\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna kill Maritza.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.21,0:37:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.31,0:37:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 但她救了我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who saved our asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.11,0:37:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你说要把所有事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you wanted to keep things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都公事公办的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straightly business.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.34,0:37:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没记错的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well last time I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.19,0:37:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该做的不就是猎杀怪物的差事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in the business of killing monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.31,0:37:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想把所有关于我们俩的事情公事公办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to keep things straightly business between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.07,0:37:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我好歹还有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still have a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.65,0:37:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被Gadreel附身的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I crossed path with a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.21,0:38:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一被一个猎人发现了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back when I was possessed by Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.00,0:38:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有可能会死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have been up dead too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.06,0:38:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是我的错吗 是我的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I deserve that, I deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.47,0:38:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么买去秘鲁的单程票吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So one-way ticket to Peru.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.05,0:38:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.14,0:38:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…un hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.33,0:38:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.95,0:38:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你那天说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what you said the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.31,0:38:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你完全没听进去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it didn't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.54,0:38:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.61,0:38:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your head back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.94,0:39:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是在那所教堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your head at that church.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.27,0:39:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.79,0:39:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我想得不够周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not think things all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.11,0:39:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我做的所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay but what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.73,0:39:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是最正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do because it's the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.59,0:39:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.06,0:39:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.72,0:39:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你是我的救世主 是我的哥哥 我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're my savior, my brother, the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.72,0:39:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时准备救我 即使在你搞砸的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swoop in, even when you mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.29,0:39:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认定你的选择是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think what you're doing is worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不断的说服自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you convince yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所造成的伤害并不足以压过好的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing more good than bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.24,0:39:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.76,0:39:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin死了 Crowley不知所踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Kevin's died, Crowley's in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.88,0:39:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不知道怎么对付那帮天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no close to this beating angel thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.26,0:39:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.43,0:39:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活着究竟有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the upside of me being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.30,0:39:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.33,0:40:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起并肩奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight in the good fight together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.36,0:40:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.21,0:40:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.50,0:40:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是为了我而救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't save me for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.54,0:40:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.02,0:40:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.20,0:40:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经做好赴死的准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready to die, I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不应该活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.43,0:40:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想自己一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.09,0:40:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是全部的症结所在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, that's what all this boils down to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.83,0:40:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法忍受没有我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stand the thought of being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.66,0:40:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你明说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有随时牺牲自己的决心 这毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certainly willing to do the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.71,0:40:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但前提是最后受伤的人不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you're not the one being hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.32,0:40:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想开诚布公吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you wanna be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.47,0:40:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你 如果当时我们俩情况对调\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the situation were reversed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.04,0:40:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是那个奄奄一息的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.41,0:40:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会为我做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.17,0:41:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.85,0:41:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.70,0:41:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在同样的情况下 我不会救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same circumstances, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.94,0:41:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get to bed.
